# Conformance

This repository **targets** Platform Architecture Guide @@GUIDE_VERSION@@
(`FND-CONF-001`). It switches to "Conforms to" when the list of open rules
below is empty and CI passes (`FND-CONF-006`); until then it stays out of
`platform.lock` (`FND-CONF-005`).

